                "id": "story",
                "variant": "imageLeft",
                "colors": "page",
                "title": "A small, local team",
                "text": "<p>Dan started Brightside in 2010 with one van and a toolbag. Today there are two of us, and most of our work comes from people who've used us before or been told about us by a neighbour.</p><p>We'd rather do fewer jobs well than rush, so we'll always tell you honestly when we can fit you in.</p>",
